## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** GPT 5.3 Codex Spark (GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark)
- **Short description:** A ChatGPT Pro research preview of the GPT-5.3 Codex coding model, served on Cerebras hardware for real-time coding at 1000+ tokens/second. **Deprecated** — OpenAI recommends evaluating GPT-5.3-Codex for all new work.
- **Provider / access:** ChatGPT Pro research preview; not a standard public OpenAI API model. No OpenCode Zen ID. Not available for normal API consumption.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-02-12 (preview); deprecated. Knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.3-codex-spark`; OpenCode Zen tracks it as `opencode/gpt-5.3-codex-spark`. No public API model ID for general use.
- **Context window:** 131K tokens (LLM Reference); max output not published.
- **Modalities:** text in / text out (capabilities listed: JSON/tool use, structured outputs, code execution). No image/audio/video documented.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** **No tracked provider token pricing is available** — it is not a standard public API model.
- **Architecture:** proprietary decoder-only; specialised for code; pretrained (weights not released). Cerebras-hardware serving.

